# Who must look at a change before it merges. GitHub applies the LAST matching pattern, so the
# catch-all goes first and the narrower, riskier paths below override it.
#
# Today there is one maintainer, so every line names the same account and this file does two
# things only: it auto-requests that review on every PR, and it lists which paths carry the
# constitution's non-negotiables (.specify/memory/constitution.md) so a second maintainer or a
# team can be dropped in per path without anyone re-deriving the map. It does NOT block a merge
# by itself — that needs the "Require review from Code Owners" branch-protection rule on `main`,
# which is deliberately not enabled while a sole maintainer could never approve their own PR.
# Turn that rule on the day a second code owner exists; nothing in this file needs to change.

*                                   @truongpx396

# The constitution itself — amended only through /speckit-constitution and a PR (CLAUDE.md).
/.specify/memory/constitution.md    @truongpx396

# Principle I (tenant isolation), VI (untrusted content is data): the identity context and the
# code that fences untrusted text.
/app/core/security.py               @truongpx396
/app/core/untrusted.py              @truongpx396

# Principles II and IV (approval gate, exactly-once side effects): capability tiers, the HITL
# gate, idempotency, and the one place tenant-scoped SQL connections are pooled.
/app/agent/tools.py                 @truongpx396
/app/agent/tool_idempotency.py      @truongpx396
/app/agent/graph_hitl.py            @truongpx396
/app/agent/sql_store.py             @truongpx396

# Every domain's write tools and the SQL behind them (side-effect-tools checklist applies).
/app/domains/*/tools.py             @truongpx396
/app/domains/*/store.py             @truongpx396

# Schema: auto-runs on a fresh volume only, so a mistake here is not a normal revert.
/postgres-init/                     @truongpx396

# What runs with secrets or ships to production, and what shapes Claude's own guardrails.
/.github/                           @truongpx396
/.claude/settings.json              @truongpx396
/.claude/hooks/                     @truongpx396
/infra/                             @truongpx396
/deploy/                            @truongpx396
/Dockerfile                         @truongpx396
/requirements.txt                   @truongpx396
/requirements-lock.txt              @truongpx396
